Name:Rules pilot 477 - Devoid gets past protection
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hill Giant (3/3) and have Pyroclasm and Kozilek's Return (devoid; 2 damage to each creature) in hand, with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls an untapped Kor Firewalker (2/2, protection from red). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-devoid-colorless-protection | A devoid card is colorless (CR 702.114a), so Kor Firewalker's protection from red does not prevent Kozilek's Return's damage (CR 702.16e): it kills the Firewalker, the Giant survives and attacks for 3; Pyroclasm is a red source, its damage to the Firewalker is prevented and the Firewalker blocks
